<title>USA: CCC reduces soymeal tonnage in Guatemala tender.</title>
<headline>CCC reduces soymeal tonnage in Guatemala tender.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp reduced the soymeal tonnage it seeks for Guatemala to 1,389 tonnes from 4,560 tonnes, the CCC said Tuesday.</p>
<p>All other details were unchanged. The tender was set for Wednesday with shipment to be July 17-31.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
